AgentMax skills layer
=====================

The skill model and the bundled skill definitions (types.py and
data/*.toml) are adapted from the OpenJarvis project:

    OpenJarvis — https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis
    Copyright the OpenJarvis authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes from the original include: renaming to the AgentMax namespace,
modernized type hints, a tomllib-based loader and SkillRegistry, a
dependency-injected SkillExecutor (decoupled from the OpenJarvis engine), and
a ToolTranslator mapping OpenJarvis tool names to AgentMax tool ids. The
heavier OpenJarvis subsystems (Ed25519 signing, remote skill sources,
dependency graphs, importer/overlay) were intentionally not ported.
